<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney starts aerospace cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney starts aerospace cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of several aerospace companies, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- started Boeing Co and Sundstrand Corp as an outperform, the source said.</p>
<p>-- started Precision Castparts Corp, Rohr Inc and Thiokol Corp as neutral, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
